# The deploy payload is the website, and nothing else.
#
# okrdev is a framework repo that happens to contain a landing page. Without
# this file every deploy would upload docs/, skills/, templates/, tests/ and
# dist/ — none of which the site serves. Same class of problem as the plugin
# payload shipping the whole repo (issue #8); worth not repeating here.
#
# Standard .gitignore semantics: `/*` matches top-level entries only, so
# re-including /site does not fight an excluded parent directory.

/*

!/site
!/vercel.json
